RNI: emulate decal in the gaussian blur downsample on GLES without border clamp.

ANGLE-Metal exposes no GL_EXT_texture_border_clamp. The scale >= 0.5 downsample
drew with the plain texture pipeline, which then clamps to edge and smears the
edge texels into the blur halo gutter (darwin blur and drop-shadow). Take the
GLES downsample pipeline (decal in the shader) with a single tap instead.

diff --git a/engine/src/flutter/impeller/entity/contents/filters/gaussian_blur_filter_contents.cc b/engine/src/flutter/impeller/entity/contents/filters/gaussian_blur_filter_contents.cc
index 917c11d3..d1f5f85b 100644
